      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW OPPA (1) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing sixth (22.79) in a Grade 5 at Warrnambool. Better than last start and worth following up. LEGACY MAN (3) was a little disappointing last start at Horsham when 5th (24.10) over 410m. Great record here at the trip having never missed the frame including one win. Must be included in calculations. STAR MELI (2) scored two back when on speed but last start drifted back and could manage only a 6 length 4th at this track (22.33). Solid formlines coming through her last run. Has the ability to give this a shake. ASCEND IGLOO (6) is a last start winner who rates one of the chances again.",
